  "label": "Misogynistic Stereotype: Women are crazy or hysterical",
  "description": "This is a long-standing misogynistic trope that portrays women as emotionally unstable, irrational, or prone to outbursts. It is used to discredit women’s opinions, experiences, and agency, and is often weaponized to justify controlling or belittling them. In this meme, it is combined with racism to target Indigenous women specifically.",
